\ Not supported (plan row 9.4.8z12, small tactics 2): a later step that
\ is _ alone, which Lean ascribes the type before it ((_ : Nat), then no
\ type): 99 (exit 2), never accepted. Lean rejects it too
\ (batch-small-2-wrong.lean's u_calc_hole).
theorem u_calc_hole
  Nat explicit: a  Nat explicit: b  a b = explicit: h1  a b =
:= by
  by-calc[ a b = ' h1  _ ' h1 ]
end u_calc_hole
